{"id":"e56e1132597c40e3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3FiniteInput.md","title":"L3FiniteInput","display":"L3FiniteInput","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"L3FiniteInput","parameters":["g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"L3FiniteInput"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：三值语义与有限表证书。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ L3FiniteInput g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and (@ Finite g) (and (@ FormsL g) (@ FmL a)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee0b315916cb8bff\" href=\"?note=ee0b315916cb8bff\" title=\"ZFC_Finite\">Finite</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2599832c1bfb4f3c\" href=\"?note=2599832c1bfb4f3c\" title=\"ZFC_FmL\">FmL</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95b6d8d91e150f2c\" href=\"?note=95b6d8d91e150f2c\" title=\"ZFC_FormsL\">FormsL</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-